    CONSIDER `s 409(3) the company is for the time being entitled to an exemption conferred by regulations under section 409(3) in respect of the information`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "Information in respect of which a company is for the time being entitled to any exemption conferred by regulations under section 409(3)": whether the exemption exists is s 409(3), outside this Part

@ref s 826(1)(b) Information protected from wider disclosure (src:11108-11108)
GIVEN `s 409(3) the company is for the time being entitled to an exemption conferred by regulations under section 409(3) in respect of the information` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 826(1)(b) the information must not be made available under section 811` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 409(3) the company is for the time being entitled to an exemption conferred by regulations under section 409(3) in respect of the information`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "Information in respect of which a company is for the time being entitled to any exemption conferred by regulations under section 409(3)": whether the exemption exists is s 409(3), outside this Part

-- src:11109 | (2) Where any such information is omitted from a report under section 805, that fact must be stated in the report.
@ref s 826(2) Information protected from wider disclosure (src:11109-11109)
